WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.440
Likewise, in a period of just seven months,

00:02.440 --> 00:06.480
I have ended seven unendable wars.

00:06.480 --> 00:08.400
They said they were unendable.

00:08.400 --> 00:10.280
You're never going to get them solved.

00:10.280 --> 00:13.680
Some were going for 31 years, two of them.

00:13.680 --> 00:15.580
31, think of it, 31 years.

00:15.580 --> 00:16.880
One was 36 years.

